Afterlife Server Rules
General Rules:
• 1.0 No Hacking, Cheating, Duping, Exploiting or loot cycling
• 1.1 No use of Nvidia Inspector
• 1.2 No toxic behavior (hate speech, rasism or homophobia)
• 1.3 No moonwalk, ice walking or meatballing
• 1.4 No vortexing (Glitching your head through objects to gain an advantage)
• 1.5 No meta-gaming (leak baselocations, pvp positions)
• 1.6 No streamsniping
• 1.7 No second account (alt account) - One player is allowed to play only on one account
• 1.8 No abuse of bugs or glitches (game breaking bugs must be reported via ticket - others must be reported in the designated Discord channel)
• 1.9 Do not impersonate as admin or owner
• 1.10 Do not be disrespectful to staffs or call them out for admin abuse (contact server owners)
• 1.11 No logout in Bunker, Key or Keycard rooms (If the game crashes or the server restarts, you must log back in. If you do not log back in, it will be considered as logging out)
• 1.13 Do not abuse the dogtag trader - kill your friends and collect their dogtags
• 1.14 Do not abuse trader failures (they must be reported via ticket)
• 1.15 Do not abuse render errors and use them
• 1.16 Do not call out hackers in the global chat, open a ticket!
• 1.17 Do not call out bugs or failures in the global chat!
• 1.18 Players with CF tools access must not share screenshots or information from other players, this can result in a ban
